      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const inp = $input.first().json;\nconst tier = inp.confirmed_response_tier;\n\nconst opening_system_prompt =\n`You are the Opening Constructor for VRYOH RDA. Produce one opening sentence only. No preamble. No explanation. No JSON wrapper.\n\nTASK: Write the opening sentence of a public response to a hospitality review. Apply the rule for the response tier below.\n\nFOR T1 — no staff member named in the review:\nSelect the first matching construction:\n- GUEST WORD LEAD: guest emphasizes a specific word (\"best\", \"perfect\", \"impeccable\", \"recomendado\", \"increíble\"):\n  → \"[Guest name], that word '[their word]' is exactly what our team works to earn.\"\n- OCCASION LEAD: guest describes a special occasion (birthday, anniversary, celebration):\n  → \"[Guest name], a [occasion] that feels [their description] — that is what our team is here for.\"\n- SPECIFIC DETAIL LEAD: guest names a specific dish or drink:\n  → \"[Dish name] deserves that kind of praise, [Guest name] — our kitchen will hear this.\"\n- BELONGING LEAD: guest is new to area or discovering restaurant for first time:\n  → \"[Guest name], welcome to the neighborhood — we are glad you found us.\"\n- GRATITUDE LEAD (fallback):\n  → \"Thank you for this, [Guest name] — it means more than a quick reply can say.\"\nIf no guest name available: open with a specific detail from the review instead.\n\nFOR T2:\nOpen with \"Hi [Guest name] —\" or \"Hello [Guest name] —\" in English. \"Hola [Guest name] —\" in Spanish. What follows must reflect the specific signal — not a formula.\nIf no guest name available: open with a specific detail from the signal.\n\nFOR T3:\nOpen with \"Hello [Guest name] —\" in English. \"Hola [Guest name] —\" in Spanish. Tone is grave and human — not warm, not transactional.\nIf no guest name available: open with the specific nature of the harm described.\n\nCRITICAL RULES:\n- One sentence only. Nothing else.\n- Guest name must appear when available.\n- Never use \"Knowing\" as an opening word.\n- Never use \"landed\" as the primary acknowledgment verb.\n- Sentence ends with period, em dash continuation, or natural punctuation.\n\nLANGUAGE: If lang_resolved is \"es\", write in Spanish. Same quality standard applies.`;\n\nconst opening_user_prompt =\n`RESPONSE TIER: ${tier}\\n` +\n`GUEST NAME: ${inp.guest_name || 'Not available'}\\n` +\n`SIGNAL TYPE: ${inp.signal_type}\\n` +\n`TONE STYLE: ${inp.tone_style}\\n` +\n`EMOTION HYPOTHESIS: ${inp.emotion_hypothesis || 'Not available'}\\n` +\n`KEYWORDS FROM REVIEW: ${inp.keywords || 'Not available'}\\n` +\n`ENRICHED EMOTION: ${inp.enriched_emotion_tag || 'Not available'}\\n` +\n(inp.behavioral_interpretation ? `BEHAVIORAL CONTEXT: ${inp.behavioral_interpretation}\\n` : '') +\n`LANGUAGE: ${inp.lang_resolved}\\n` +\n`\\nProduce one opening sentence only. No preamble.`;\n\nconst opening_prompt_body = JSON.stringify({\n  model: 'claude-sonnet-4-6',\n  max_tokens: 150,\n  temperature: 0,\n  system: opening_system_prompt,\n  messages: [{ role: 'user', content: opening_user_prompt }]\n});\n\nreturn [{ json: {\n  bra_record_id:              inp.bra_record_id,\n  confirmed_response_tier:    inp.confirmed_response_tier,\n  governance_flag:            inp.governance_flag,\n  human_review_required:      inp.human_review_required,\n  solution_type:              inp.solution_type,\n  emotional_axis:             inp.emotional_axis,\n  pain_axis:                  inp.pain_axis,\n  stability_axis:             inp.stability_axis,\n  signal_based_consideration: inp.signal_based_consideration,\n  tone_style:                 inp.tone_style,\n  urgency_level:              inp.urgency_level,\n  commercial_risk_flag:       inp.commercial_risk_flag,\n  behavioral_interpretation:  inp.behavioral_interpretation,\n  lang:                       inp.lang,\n  lang_resolved:              inp.lang_resolved,\n  client_id:                  inp.client_id,\n  enriched_emotion_tag:       inp.enriched_emotion_tag,\n  enriched_pain_point:        inp.enriched_pain_point,\n  pain_point_sub_category:    inp.pain_point_sub_category,\n  signal_type:                inp.signal_type,\n  intensity_level:            inp.intensity_level,\n  hsi_record_id:              inp.hsi_record_id,\n  ess_record_id:              inp.ess_record_id,\n  eip_record_id:              inp.eip_record_id,\n  ala_record_id:              inp.ala_record_id,\n  prior_run_id:               inp.prior_run_id,\n  reviewer_handle:            inp.reviewer_handle,\n  emotion_hypothesis:         inp.emotion_hypothesis,\n  keywords:                   inp.keywords,\n  brand_voice:                inp.brand_voice,\n  guest_name:                 inp.guest_name,\n  has_staff:                  inp.has_staff,\n  opening_prompt_body:        opening_prompt_body\n} }];"
